            "review_text": "Dũng Phạm\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nLovely day at Arul House\nApr 2026 • Friends\nI had a really lovely day at Arul House. The place feels warm and peaceful, and it's clear that a lot of care has gone into celebrating Ê-Đê culture through both the space and the food.\n\nEverything we ordered was delicious, and the staff were friendly, which made the experience even more enjoyable.\n\nIf you're looking for something a little different from the usual, I'd definitely recommend giving Arul House a try.\nRead more\nWritten August 4, 2026",
